{"seq":3,"slug":"pity-systems-pseudo-random","title":"保底与伪随机分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/pity-systems-pseudo-random","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"保底与伪随机分布\">保底与伪随机分布</h1><p>把一枚 1% 出货率的骰子掷 100 次，约有 37% 的玩家一次都不出货——纯独立同分布随机的这条残酷长尾，是现代游戏体感设计的头号敌人。<a href=\"loot-tables-drop-rates\">掉落表</a> 与 <a href=\"procedural-itemization\">程序化词缀</a> 给出了产出的骨架与血肉，本篇给出护栏：用伪随机分布（PRD）和保底计数器把「连续 50 次不出货」的方差压下去，让随机既保留惊喜又不至于劝退。这是抽卡类与刷子类游戏的命门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>纯随机（每次独立、概率恒定）在数学上公平，在体感上残忍——它允许任意长的连续不出货。修正方案有两条路：伪随机分布让概率随失败次数递增（软性、隐式），保底计数器在固定次数后强制出货（硬性、显式）。两者常组合使用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[每次抽取] --&gt; B{用哪种分布?}&#10;  B --&gt;|纯随机 IID| C[概率恒定&lt;br/&gt;方差大·有长尾]&#10;  B --&gt;|伪随机 PRD| D[概率随失败递增&lt;br/&gt;压低方差]&#10;  B --&gt;|保底计数器| E[失败累加计数&lt;br/&gt;到阈值强制出货]&#10;  D --&gt; F[体感平滑·无极端长尾]&#10;  E --&gt; G[硬上限·最差情况可控]&#10;  C -.玩家挫败.-&gt; H[流失风险]\">flowchart TD\n  A[每次抽取] --&gt; B{用哪种分布?}\n  B --&gt;|纯随机 IID| C[概率恒定&lt;br/&gt;方差大·有长尾]\n  B --&gt;|伪随机 PRD| D[概率随失败递增&lt;br/&gt;压低方差]\n  B --&gt;|保底计数器| E[失败累加计数&lt;br/&gt;到阈值强制出货]\n  D --&gt; F[体感平滑·无极端长尾]\n  E --&gt; G[硬上限·最差情况可控]\n  C -.玩家挫败.-&gt; H[流失风险]</pre><p>理解这套机制的关键，是区分「平均出货率」与「体感方差」。纯随机和 PRD 可以有相同的平均出货率，但 PRD 把概率分布收紧到均值附近，消灭了让玩家暴怒的极端长尾。保底则进一步给出一个硬性的最差情况上界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>概率变化</th>\n<th>最差情况</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯随机 IID</td>\n<td>恒定</td>\n<td>无上界（理论上永不出）</td>\n<td>早期游戏、休闲掉落</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伪随机分布 PRD</td>\n<td>随失败线性递增</td>\n<td>软上界（接近必出）</td>\n<td>Dota/Dota2 暴击、闪避</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软保底</td>\n<td>某阈值后概率陡升</td>\n<td>硬上界</td>\n<td>Genshin 抽卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬保底</td>\n<td>到阈值直接给</td>\n<td>确定上界</td>\n<td>多数 gacha 的 90 抽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"伪随机分布-prd-让概率随失败递增\">伪随机分布（PRD）：让概率随失败递增</h2><p>伪随机分布由 Warcraft III / Dota 引入，用于暴击与闪避。它的核心是：每次失败后，下次成功的概率增加一个常量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>；一旦成功，概率重置回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次尝试的成功概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(n) = C \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（在尚未成功的前提下）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public sealed class PrdRoller {&#10;    private readonly double c;   // 每次失败的概率增量&#10;    private int fails = 0;       // 连续失败次数&#10;    public PrdRoller(double c) =&gt; this.c = c;&#10;    public bool Roll(Random rng) {&#10;        double p = c * (fails + 1);          // 本次成功概率 P(n)=C*n&#10;        if (rng.NextDouble() &lt; p) { fails = 0; return true; }  // 成功重置&#10;        fails++; return false;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public sealed class PrdRoller {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly double c;   // 每次失败的概率增量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private int fails = 0;       // 连续失败次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public PrdRoller(double c) => this.c = c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public bool Roll(Random rng) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        double p = c * (fails + 1);          // 本次成功概率 P(n)=C*n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (rng.NextDouble() &#x3C; p) { fails = 0; return true; }  // 成功重置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fails++; return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键在于：给定一个期望平均触发率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（比如想要 25% 暴击的体感），对应的常量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 并不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而要解一个方程使 PRD 的长期均值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——25% 暴击对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 约为 0.0847。这是 PRD 最反直觉之处：填错常量会让实际触发率偏离目标。PRD 的收益是显著压低方差：玩家几乎不会遇到「连暴 5 次」或「20 次不暴」的极端，体感稳定得多。这种把随机性「驯服」的思路，与 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">战斗系统的暴击与命中</a> 的手感调校紧密相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保底计数器-抽卡的硬护栏\">保底计数器：抽卡的硬护栏</h2><p>抽卡（gacha）游戏不能容忍「氪了 300 抽还不出」的公关灾难，于是引入保底计数器：维护一个「距上次出货的抽数」，到达阈值就强制或大幅提升出货。以《原神》为例（截至 2026 年），其机制是软保底加硬保底的组合：基础 5 星概率约 0.6%，从第 74 抽起进入软保底、概率陡升约 10 倍至 6% 以上，绝大多数 5 星落在第 75–82 抽之间；第 90 抽为硬保底，必出 5 星（来源：genshintactics.com 2026 保底指南、buffget.com 软保底解析）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[每次抽取计数 +1] --&gt; B{counter &gt;= 74?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[基础概率 0.6%]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[软保底·概率陡升至 ~6%+]&#10;  C --&gt; E{出 5 星?}&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[counter 归零]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G{counter == 90?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[硬保底·强制给 5 星]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| A&#10;  F --&gt; I[5星后判定 50/50]\">graph TD\n  A[每次抽取计数 +1] --&gt; B{counter &gt;= 74?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[基础概率 0.6%]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[软保底·概率陡升至 ~6%+]\n  C --&gt; E{出 5 星?}\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt;|是| F[counter 归零]\n  E --&gt;|否| G{counter == 90?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[硬保底·强制给 5 星]\n  G --&gt;|否| A\n  F --&gt; I[5星后判定 50/50]</pre><p>原神还叠了第二层保底——「50/50」机制：出 5 星后有 50% 概率是当期 UP 角色；若歪了（出常驻），则下一个 5 星必为 UP，且该「保底状态」永久跨卡池保留不过期。最坏情况是先 90 抽歪一次、再 90 抽保底，共 180 抽必得 UP（来源：BitTopup 原神保底指南）。保底计数器是玩家可见状态，必须服务器权威持久化——客户端绝不能自行维护，否则就是无限刷保底的外挂，详见 <a href=\"../practice/networking-persistence\">网络同步与持久化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"体感-信任与监管\">体感、信任与监管</h2><p>保底与 PRD 不只是工程技巧，它们是与玩家的一份心理契约。公开保底规则、显示当前计数、给出「最多 N 抽必出」的承诺，能把抽卡从赌博焦虑转化为可规划的目标——玩家愿意为「我再 20 抽就到保底」付出，远多于为一个无底洞付出。许多地区的法规（如中国对抽卡概率公示的要求、部分国家把开箱视为赌博的审查）也强制要求公示真实概率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[公示真实概率] --&gt; B[玩家可计算期望]&#10;  C[显示保底计数] --&gt; D[把焦虑转为目标]&#10;  B --&gt; E[信任与留存]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[健康的氪金意愿]\">graph TD\n  A[公示真实概率] --&gt; B[玩家可计算期望]\n  C[显示保底计数] --&gt; D[把焦虑转为目标]\n  B --&gt; E[信任与留存]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[健康的氪金意愿]</pre><p>这条「透明度换信任」的设计哲学，把保底机制与 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/gacha-battle-pass\">商业化与 LiveOps</a> 的伦理及变现紧密缝合——本 hub 只负责保底机制的数学与实现，其商业伦理与监管合规由该 hub 深入。重铸出货、刷子掉落同样能套用 PRD 思路平滑体感，呼应 <a href=\"procedural-itemization\">程序化词缀与品质</a> 的重 roll 设计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>纯随机在数学上公平、体感上残忍，允许任意长连续不出货；护栏有 PRD（软性递增）与保底计数器（硬性强制）。</li>\n<li>PRD 让概率随失败线性递增 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(n)=C \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、成功即重置，显著压低方差；目标触发率对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 需解方程，非直接相等（25% 暴击对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.0847</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\approx 0.0847</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0847</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>原神（2026）为软+硬保底组合：0.6% 基础、第 74 抽软保底陡升至 6%+、第 90 抽硬保底，外加永久跨卡池的 50/50，最坏 180 抽必得 UP。</li>\n<li>保底计数器是玩家可见状态，必须服务器权威持久化，否则成外挂温床。</li>\n<li>保底是与玩家的心理契约，公示概率与计数把赌博焦虑转为可规划目标，也是法规要求。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>产出骨架与动态权重见 <a href=\"loot-tables-drop-rates\">掉落表与概率</a>；重 roll 体感见 <a href=\"procedural-itemization\">程序化词缀与品质</a>；保底状态的服务器持久化见 <a href=\"../practice/networking-persistence\">网络同步与持久化</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：暴击手感见 <a href=\"../../combat-system-design/hit-resolution/damage-formulas-scaling\">战斗系统设计</a>；抽卡变现与伦理见 <a href=\"../../game-monetization-liveops/monetization-design/gacha-battle-pass\">商业化与 LiveOps</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保底与伪随机分布","id":"保底与伪随机分布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"伪随机分布（PRD）：让概率随失败递增","id":"伪随机分布-prd-让概率随失败递增"},{"level":2,"text":"保底计数器：抽卡的硬护栏","id":"保底计数器-抽卡的硬护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"体感、信任与监管","id":"体感-信任与监管"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"程序化词缀与品质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/loot-generation/procedural-itemization"},"next":{"title":"掉落与经济平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/inventory-loot-itemization/practice/economy-balance-loot"}}